    "issues": [
      {
        "code": "CONTROL_EVIDENCE_ADAPTER",
        "detail": "R0 omitted the shared validation/user-evidence adapter, causing valid proposals and derived calculations to be penalized for missing provenance. Original generations and scores are retained; this is not evidence that the production baseline cannot make those proposals."
      },
      {
        "code": "PLANNER_BACKEND_GRAMMAR",
        "detail": "Both query backend fields were exposed in one grammar. Wren repeatedly selected custom plans that the backend gate correctly rejected. A later development version exposes only the permitted backend schema and actual typed Wren columns."
      },
      {
        "code": "DISPATCH_STARTUP_GAPS",
        "detail": "Three early route requests expired during manual-to-continuous dispatcher transition. These are harness errors, not established provider outages. The continuously logged319requests all returnedHTTP200."
      }
    ],
    "interpretation": "Complete unchanged data proves measurement coverage/integrity only. These known defects make this pilot unsuitable for selecting an architecture. No held-out questions were used to make the fixes."
  },
